<title>USA: Suburban Lodges Q1 net increases.</title>
<headline>Suburban Lodges Q1 net increases.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA, Ga. 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997	    1996</p>
<p> Total revenue				3,922,664     1,669,323</p>
<p> Net income				   1,257,181	 307,629</p>
<p> Earnings per common share		     0.11</p>
<p> Pro forma net income					   374,000</p>
<p> Pro forma earnings per share				    0.06</p>
<p>Weighted average shares</p>
<p>  outstanding				11,733,061     6,622,251</p>
<p>NOTE:  Suburban Lodges of America Inc reported pro forma results for 1996 because the presentation of historical earnings per share for periods prior to May 28, 1996, are not meaningful because the outstanding shares or other equity interests of the predecessor entities differ substantially from the shares of common stock of the company outstanding after its initial public offering in May 1996 and a secondary offering in November 1996.</p>
</text>
